-- CAPABILITY --------- errors/mock_handler_field_1.march

The handler of a `mock IO.Console` has no field `println`. Its fields are: `io_read_byte`, `io_read_line`, `print`, `print_line`, `print_stderr`. [mock_handler_field]

6 |     mock IO.Console with { println: Some(fn _ -> ()) } do
                               ^^^^^^^

    run `march --explain mock_handler_field`


